<section class="technology" id="technology">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">核心科技：低温冷制 + 精简配方</h2>
    
    <div class="tech-block">
      <div class="tech-image"><img src="{{ 'slide5_img0_18.png' | asset_url }}" alt="45天冷制工艺"></div>
      <div class="tech-text">
        <span class="badge">CORE TECHNOLOGY 01</span>
        <h3>45天古法冷制锁活</h3>
        <p class="tech-highlight">核心优势：活性成分0流失，让清洁变成深度养护</p>
        
        <div class="tech-stats">
          <div class="tech-stat">
            <span class="tech-stat-value">&lt;40℃</span>
            <span class="tech-stat-label">低温恒温入模</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-stat">
            <span class="tech-stat-value">0</span>
            <span class="tech-stat-label">破坏锁住草本活性</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-stat">
            <span class="tech-stat-value">45天</span>
            <span class="tech-stat-label">自然周期皂化</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <p class="tech-desc">减少高温破坏，尽可能保留草本活性。通过更长周期皂化，让清洁与养护更平衡，日常使用更稳定。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="tech-block reverse">
      <div class="tech-image"><img src="{{ 'slide6_img0_26.png' | asset_url }}" alt="精简配方"></div>
      <div class="tech-text">
        <span class="badge">CORE TECHNOLOGY 02</span>
        <h3>精简刺激性成分</h3>
        <p>不依赖强刺激添加，降低头皮负担，长期使用更友好。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.tech-block {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 48px;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.tech-block.reverse { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
.tech-image { flex: 1; }
.tech-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; }
.tech-text { flex: 1; }
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #4a7c3f;
  color: white;
  padding: 4px 16px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.tech-text h3 { font-size: 24px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.tech-highlight { font-size: 16px; color: #4a7c3f; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.tech-stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.tech-stat {
  background: #f0f5eb;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 16px;
  text-align: center;
  flex: 1;
}
.tech-stat-value {
  display: block;
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #4a7c3f;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.tech-stat-label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #666;
}
.tech-desc { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .tech-block, .tech-block.reverse { flex-direction: column; }
  .tech-stats { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>

